#3001
newbiequest #1: Kill a Midgaard child~
Hello, $n!  I have a small task for you, if
you're game.  I want you to find one of the
children wandering town, and fight it to the
death!  If you win, bring the proof of your
kill back here and give it to me, and I shall
reward you.
~
Find a little boy or a little girl and kill them, then return the
proof of the kill to the Questmaster.
~
