#3002
newbiequest #2: Find a scroll of knowing~
Hello!  I have an object here that I wish to
learn about.  Could you please go and find me
an ancient scroll of knowing?  I will pay you
for your trouble!
~
Find an ancient scroll of knowing and return it to the Questmaster.  You
can find them on many of the creatures in town, or you can buy them from
the Magic Shop.  There is also one that appears in the Donation Room from
time to time.
~
