#3030
Positioner Getter Helper etc~
So you want to be the Master of Midgaard?  You must prove to me that you know
all that there is to know about Midgaard if you want that title.  I will give
you a series of challenges.  If you pass them all, you will be deemed a
Master of Midgaard.  The first challenge put before you is this:  Bring me
the head of one each of the helper mobs that are scattered about that are
meant to explain what to do to new citizens of Ravenmud.  I am referring to 
the Helper, Reader, Socialite and other such mobs.  Do this and be rewarded! 
~
I am referring to the Helper, Reader, Socialite and other such mobs.  Do this
and be rewarded!
~
